 "build": {
  "id": "c46d80a6-1be2-409f-a4be-a582143fdc0d",
  "title": "Oathkeeper tank build",
  "description": "[rotation]\nSingle oath (condemn for bosses, cleave or lunge depending on mob count), oath break with blade of faith then reckoning or benediction depending on dmg, weave in sacred swing (let the shield pop for extra damage), rotate librams when oathkeeper is ~50%\n\nStack condemn to 3 on bosses\nUse other defensive cds \n\nFor aoe spam cleave to target count then faith and reckoning with sacred swing mixed in. \n\nHigh dmg spam benediction and reckoning. \n\nExecute with titanstrike",
